<newsitem itemid="164512" id="root" date="1996-11-04" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Telewest Q3 pretax loss widens, sales rise.</title>
<headline>Telewest Q3 pretax loss widens, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)	 loss 6.4		    vs 3.5 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		loss 59.12		  vs 29.41 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   73.12		  vs 32.24</p>
<p> Operating loss	   27.92		  vs 20.11 loss</p>
<p> Associates loss	  3.96		   vs 3.53 loss</p>
<p> Interest paid	    27.24		  vs 0.31</p>
<p> Net taxed loss	   59.18		  vs 29.40 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - British cable franchisee Telewest Plc said its cable television penetration rate was stable at 21.2 percent while its telephony penetration rate was higher at 26.8 percent compared to 23.1 percent in year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
